Recommends: tailscale,
Description: Send files to Tailscale devices from the KDE Share menu
 A KDE Purpose plugin that adds "Send via Tailscale…" to the Share menu of
 Dolphin, Gwenview, Spectacle and other KDE applications, and to the Dolphin
 context menu of folders. It sends the selected files to a device in your
 tailnet with Taildrop.
 .
 Sending happens in the background, in one queue for all applications: the
 transfer shows its progress in Plasma and can be cancelled there, and a
 notification reports the result with a Retry action. Folders are packed
 into an archive before they are sent. The Share dialog shows whether each
 device is reached directly or through a relay.
